      "id": "claim_b748c13ffef4424890aa4cdea910404f",
      "statement": "`lcchess grade` requires a project (--project or LANGSMITH_PROJECT); explicit --thread/--threads-file ids cannot be combined with --since, --until, --limit or --metadata, which instead select threads from a project query; option errors become Typer BadParameter usage errors.",
