      "id": "claim_ccae94db48c44490a152d2ae81dc273a",
      "statement": "EnginePool hands each analyse call to whichever engine is idle via a FIFO queue, and sends ucinewgame on every analysis (fresh game object) so results do not depend on previously searched positions; a failed startup quits engines already started.",
