    {
      "id": "claim_b49f9d66c7d1437095d2c08330ef4c57",
      "statement": "Move quality is 'best' when the played move equals the engine's best move, otherwise a Lichess judgement (winning-chance drop of 0.3/0.2/0.1 for blunder/mistake/inaccuracy, special handling for mate transitions) or 'good'; cp values are clamped to ±1000 with mates counting as ±1000.",
      "evidence": [
